+		 * sets it, so a signal here can be our own from the last
+		 * stop_capture, left when the game wasn't drawing (the hook
+		 * only looks while it captures). Taken as the hook stopping,
+		 * it ended each try at once and was set again for the next,
+		 * until the game drew its first frame. */
+		ResetEvent(gc->hook_stop);
